          "ref": [
            6,
            40
          ],
          "pages": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "The principal fibers of the periodontal ligament are arranged in six groups that develop sequentially in the developing root: • Transseptal • Alveolar crest • Horizontal • Oblique • Apical • Interradicular fibers"
